{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Behold</b> — Rabbi Moses said: the accent of אדני in סמכי נפשי is not one of the supporters, but rather its accent stands alone against all the supporters. And in my opinion: he prayed that HaShem would judge them—those who seek his harm—and help those who would entrust themselves to him and not inform against him."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 54, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:31:45.944418887Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}